{"id": "34500", "title": "偷吃要擦嘴", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34500.htm", "intro": "她是个美丽的惊叹号，天真混淆著性感，他最受不住拥有一双美腿的女性穿裙子，虽说他对美女的包容度像大海一样，哪种类型都能勾引起他想恋爱的感觉，只是，难道是电力不足，还是魅力缩减？两回相遇，她压根没把他的殷勤放心上，更何况他是如此的潇洒俊帅、风流倜傥，邀她一同乘爱之船，她说她眼睛痛，不过跟她提议来场短暂浪漫的异国恋，她拿起菜刀追杀，并送上一记闭门羹，这怎么可能？！他体贴温柔、多情又多金，女孩们都喜欢他……难道不是吗？她却让他想“从良”的心一再受打击，甚至当他决定为她冒险跳入婚姻坟墓时，她没说一声掰掰的不见踪影……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34500", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188859.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188860.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188862.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188865.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188866.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188867.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188868.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188870.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188881.html", "available": false}, {"t